  "metaRegistry": "https://w3id.org/ogc/bblocks/meta-register.json",
  "name": "Building Blocks - OGC API - Connected Systems Building Blocks",
  "abstract": "Data models of the OGC API - Connected Systems standard and its underlying SWE Common 3.0 and SensorML 3.0 encodings, as reusable building blocks.\n",
  "description": "Draft conversion of the JSON schemas maintained in [opengeospatial/ogcapi-connected-systems](https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogcapi-connected-systems)\ninto building blocks. Scope is limited to data models (no OpenAPI paths/parameters, no XML encodings).\nSemantic annotations (JSON-LD contexts) are not yet provided.\n",
  "modified": "2026-09-23T22:13:27.832054",
  "tooling": {
    "bblocks-postprocess": {
      "commitId": "\"6411aed037da38c6d9079d9350eca33d004a4d0c",
